Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.05,0:00:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,打杂的奴隶不可能成为角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}House slaves will never be gladiators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.03,0:00:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们缺的正是能打仗的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thing we are in short supply of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙拿来 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keys, quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.22,0:00:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,放他们出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.37,0:00:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,队伍扩大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our ranks swell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.34,0:00:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要更多武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will need more weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢你的一片心意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude for your kindness, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.67,0:00:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是特别珍惜呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know that I have treasured it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.21,0:00:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,谣言是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.45,0:00:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟她上床了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you lay with her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.77,0:00:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥诺玛默斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oenomaus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.92,0:00:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你干掉盖尤斯•克罗迪斯•葛雷博\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have you end the life of Gaius Claudius Glaber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.03,0:00:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛雷博的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glaber's own wife, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.36,0:00:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚就要前往罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}this very night leaves for Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.26,0:00:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的军队归我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your men are now mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.26,0:00:52.90,Title,0,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：复仇》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.46,0:00:57.76,Title,0,0,0,0,,《对等》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.31,0:01:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把我带到哪里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you take me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.53,0:01:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你 我怀有身孕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, I am with child{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.82,0:01:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone approaches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.33,0:01:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,老老实实跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow fucking lead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.16,0:01:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别耍心眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And do not stray from it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.07,0:01:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.75,0:01:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 你怎么走到这荒郊野地里来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What brings you so far from road, brother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.79,0:01:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,还带着个孕妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}With one so ripe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.51,0:01:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,骑的老马一命呜呼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}An ancient horse, gone to grass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.82,0:01:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条路去庞贝比较近 省得我妻子劳累\N{\fnArial\fs30}The woods offer shorter distance for my wife to Pompeii.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是不加小心 送命也快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shorter by a lifetime, if tread absent caution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.53,0:01:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯和他手下那帮畜生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus and his fucks set upon a wagon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.33,0:02:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,前几天在附近劫了辆马车\N{\fnArial\fs30}not far from here recently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.58,0:02:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.45,0:02:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我们应该赶紧上路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps, we should be on our way, my love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.26,0:02:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然噩运也会降临到我们头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless similar misfortune fall upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.18,0:02:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来你们已经很倒霉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, it appears it already has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.65,0:02:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么这副模样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you come by that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.43,0:02:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,从马上摔下来时受的伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our horse, when it fell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.70,0:02:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在去庞贝的路上 明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the road to Pompeii, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.18,0:02:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在庞贝有生计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have business there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.47,0:02:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀猪宰羊换几个钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meat and bone, carved for coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.00,0:02:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是屠夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}A butcher?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.26,0:02:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,屠夫的老婆穿这么好的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine dress, for wife of such.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.92,0:02:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a gladiator!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.71,0:02:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是民政官的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the Praetor's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.14,0:02:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.44,0:02:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.12,0:02:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody, help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.89,0:02:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.82,0:03:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再出一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise voice again, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.11,0:03:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就把你的舌头割下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will hack tongue from fucking mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.86,0:03:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出个价钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask any price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.23,0:03:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丈夫肯定愿意出钱赎回我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband will see it paid for my return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.11,0:03:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不要赎金\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seek no ransom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are going to rob me of my life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.08,0:03:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.22,0:03:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,还轮不到我来杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not mine to take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.99,0:03:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来可以一矛戳死它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have speared him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.11,0:03:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本投不了那么远\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was beyond your throw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.55,0:03:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你比我还了解我能投多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the distance better than my own hand? Do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.33,0:03:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对神勇的斯巴达克斯可是了如指掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know many things regarding the great and powerful Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.28,0:03:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,神勇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great and powerful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.71,0:03:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且正直善良\N{\fnArial\fs30}And kind and just.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.17,0:03:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能看穿你的内心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have peered into your very heart, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.21,0:04:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道你是什么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and know what it holds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.57,0:04:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你在我年轻的时候认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would not have found content so pleasing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,就知道我可不是这么好的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you had chanced upon me in my youth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.41,0:04:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那时就是头野兽 没啥人样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stood more animal than man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.83,0:04:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么驯服了你这头野兽呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what tamed the wild beast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.96,0:04:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是你的妻子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.16,0:04:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.74,0:04:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了葛雷博的老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the life of Glaber's woman, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.61,0:04:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像他杀了你老婆一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}as he took the life of yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.18,0:04:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,了结这段恩怨吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See end to vengeance, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.41,0:04:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时了结你为了复仇所造成的一切苦难\N{\fnArial\fs30}and with it the suffering of all caught between you and such desires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.83,0:05:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她出事都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am to blame for her fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.80,0:05:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没跟甘尼克斯说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had I not broken words with Gannicus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.93,0:05:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就不会知道伊莉西娅要前往罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}he never would have known Ilithyia was the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.33,0:05:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然说漏了嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}An unfortunate slip of the tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.86,0:05:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我能劝甘尼克斯浪子回头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought only to convince Gannicus of proper path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.96,0:05:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,自愿供你差遣 协助捉拿斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}To willingly follow your command and join the hunt for Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.24,0:05:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能跟那个该死的色雷斯人勾搭上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man is probably in league with the fucking Thracian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.35,0:05:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们俩先前不都是你家的奴隶吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were both slaves under your house, were they not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.03,0:05:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们之间隔了好几年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Separated by a distance of years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.92,0:05:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没有见过面\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never have met one another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.18,0:05:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能只是我们不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we have knowledge of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.47,0:05:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这都无关紧要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that it is a thing of matter now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.90,0:05:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯劫走了我的妻子和未出世的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gannicus now holds my wife and unborn child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.10,0:05:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道他们是死是活\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she yet draws breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.10,0:05:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他费这么大力气把她带出城\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would not have risked all to take her from the city{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.34,0:05:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会一刀杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}only to have her life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.38,0:05:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}She yet lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.80,0:05:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心里清楚地感受到她还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel her heart beating as though it were my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.24,0:05:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须派人搜遍城郊的每个角落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your men must scour the countryside until she is found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.48,0:06:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就目前的人手 这要花上好几个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such an area takes months to cover with numbers at hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.45,0:06:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就向罗马求救吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then send message to Rome for aid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.18,0:06:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事绝不能传出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Word of this shall not spread beyond these walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.33,0:06:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是伊莉西娅…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Ilithyia{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.14,0:06:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,从罗马民政官的眼皮底下被掳走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was snatched from grasp of a praetor of Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.07,0:06:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不希望元老院议论\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not have the Senate whisper{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.12,0:06:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我连自个儿的妻子都保护不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}of how I could not protect my own wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.24,0:06:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,明智的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}A wise choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.52,0:06:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要着眼于将来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must look towards your future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.54,0:06:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们居然还谈论政治\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talk of politics?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.17,0:06:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莉西娅是我的朋友 你的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilithyia is valued friend and wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.30,0:06:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还怀有你的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She holds the blessing of your child, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.92,0:06:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这孩子是阿比努斯的遗产继承人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and with him slim tether to Albinius' wealth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.69,0:06:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果找不到她 这些财产就跟你没关系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One which will be severed if she is not found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.74,0:06:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用你教我事情有多么严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not lecture on what is at fucking risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.50,0:06:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praetor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.02,0:06:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情办好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have seen it done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.05,0:06:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,您妻子出事现场的痕迹都抹干净了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All trace of your wife's misfortune has been erased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.70,0:06:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁也不会知道这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one will know of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:06:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.10,0:07:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫你的手下集合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gather your men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.13,0:07:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛皮娅 我有话跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seppia, I would have a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.07,0:07:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是你 就再也不会这么跟他说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not raise voice in such manner with him again, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.05,0:07:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你希望自个儿还有价值的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you wish to keep purchase in this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.41,0:07:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有了伊莉西娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absent Ilithyia's blessings, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.19,0:07:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里已经不是我的容身之地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is a place that I shall quickly tumble from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.40,0:07:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你落到那般田地的 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would never let you fall so far, my love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.94,0:07:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少目前我还挺喜欢你陪在身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not while I yet treasure your company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.89,0:07:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.95,0:07:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意观察我肩膀的角度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now keep eye on angle of my shoulders…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.15,0:07:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样你就知道我下一步…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will give clue to my next{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.24,0:08:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你学得很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}You learn quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有优势\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have advantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.87,0:08:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有战神亲自教我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of being taught by a god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.37,0:08:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.28,0:08:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈打得跟孙子似的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.47,0:08:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈鲁德斯 希望你床上功夫比格斗强
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.88,0:08:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈鲁德斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harudes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.41,0:09:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出招时大喊大叫 因此暴露了意图\N{\fnArial\fs30}You betray intent by bellowing like a crazed goat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.34,0:09:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.38,0:09:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,说你日翻了自个儿的屁眼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.07,0:09:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳美特斯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemetes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.28,0:09:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨克莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saxa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.21,0:09:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.00,0:09:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候打仗也用木棍吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we to use wooden stick in battle as well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.32,0:09:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 听奥诺玛默斯说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close mouth and heed Oenomaus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.16,0:09:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要别人指手画脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need no instruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.25,0:09:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道怎么打\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fucking know how to fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.21,0:09:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要教你的不是怎么打 而是怎么赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I instruct you not how to fight, but how to win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.84,0:09:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样才不会再次被罗马人奴役\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you do not find yourself again enslaved by the Romans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.90,0:09:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}First position!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.68,0:09:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.68,0:09:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳美特斯人说得确实有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemetes does hold argument.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.50,0:09:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我们武器紧缺是个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Towards lack of proper weapons at least.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.83,0:09:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,真见鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.13,0:09:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然把葛雷博的妻子劫来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have taken Glaber's wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.59,0:09:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.51,0:09:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是别人送到我手里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has been delivered into my hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.99,0:09:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要她得到应有的下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they will see her to proper end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.09,0:09:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whore!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.13,0:09:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快求饶啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beg for your life!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.28,0:10:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们追求的就是这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this our cause now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.19,0:10:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,欺负一个怀有身孕的弱女子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Falling upon a helpless woman heavy with child?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛雷博对我妻子何曾有过怜悯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glaber held no pity towards my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.66,0:10:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她比你面前这个贱女人更应该活在世上\N{\fnArial\fs30}A woman far more deserving than the thing that stands before you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.66,0:10:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,混账婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这穷鬼 没钱还敢来花天酒地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coin before cunt, you worthless shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.53,0:10:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now crawl from sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.67,0:10:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我爬起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up you old cunt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.03,0:10:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别忙走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Linger yet a while, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.61,0:10:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}my good man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.11,0:11:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们非常希望你能在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have the pleasure of your company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.16,0:11:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,叙利亚人 你又找我干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you seek of me now, Syrian?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.73,0:11:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gannicus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.38,0:11:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个在卡普亚颇有声望的角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gladiator of some renown in Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.36,0:11:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人发现他经常在你的地盘厮混\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has been noted to frequent your establishment, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.92,0:11:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}has he not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.51,0:11:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝花酒 玩女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Partaking of wine and whores?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.72,0:11:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Praetor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.94,0:11:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有话要跟他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have words with the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.87,0:11:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is not here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.33,0:11:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但诸位中肯定有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet there must be some among you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.45,0:11:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾和他一起饮酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}who have that cause to share drink…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.98,0:11:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,或有其他往来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and other distractions with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.64,0:11:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要知道他说过的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would know of what he spoke, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.49,0:11:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,以此找到他的藏身之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}towards revelation of where he secrets himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.64,0:11:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我想再来一杯酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I would hope for another fucking drink{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.31,0:11:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,外加一个姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a whore upon my cock{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.10,0:11:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再问一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask it of you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.89,0:12:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有人和甘尼克斯说过话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who among you has spoken with Gannicus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.91,0:12:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disappointing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.33,0:12:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.12,0:12:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.58,0:12:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过甘尼克斯跟人谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did see Gannicus break words!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.58,0:12:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was privy to them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.47,0:12:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的奴隶 玛西亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}My slave, Marcia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.76,0:12:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.02,0:12:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手下的叙利亚人把她钉在十字架上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your fucking Syrian nailed her to a cross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.26,0:12:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没有拿到应有的赔偿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have yet to receive fair compensation for loss incurred{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.09,0:12:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯夺走了我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gannicus has taken something from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.15,0:12:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will see it returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.72,0:13:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我严刑逼问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put all to question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.31,0:13:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你手下留情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please do not do this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.05,0:13:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妻子在罗马人的屠刀前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were those same words pleaded by my wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.13,0:13:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是也这么乞求过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before Roman blade ripped her forever from my arms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.96,0:13:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认识她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not know of her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.42,0:13:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的死跟我没有关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hands are unstained by the deed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.85,0:13:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你丈夫脱不了干系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your husband cannot claim such.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.06,0:13:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他把我妻子贬为奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is the one that condemned her to slavery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.66,0:13:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,她因此离开了人世\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is gone from this world because of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.27,0:13:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要报仇雪恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will have equal vengeance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.68,0:13:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can not do this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.87,0:13:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My child{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.74,0:13:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏拉和我常说要生儿育女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sura and I often spoke of children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.07,0:13:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,说我们要子孙满堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of the family we would have, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.22,0:13:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,可现在全都成了泡影\N{\fnArial\fs30}now forever denied me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.66,0:13:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要葛雷博尝尝这样的滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I now deny Glaber of his.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.66,0:13:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The child is yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.87,0:14:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骗人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.63,0:14:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看我像是在骗你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would that my tongue made false noise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.68,0:14:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然说起来很讽刺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet it sounds bitter truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.69,0:14:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在巴蒂塔斯家做过后 我的月事就没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monthly blood ceased after you came to me in Batiatus' villa…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.50,0:14:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,露迪雅答应给我克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucretia had promised Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.97,0:14:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个残酷的玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cruel jest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.48,0:14:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得吧 对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a memory that lingers, is it not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.91,0:14:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那晚的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of that night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.66,0:14:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of you inside me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.97,0:15:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.17,0:15:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是我掐住你喉咙的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}As does memory of my hands upon your throat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.81,0:15:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就做个了结吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then see to completion what they began.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.23,0:15:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我 还有你的亲骨肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take my life, and that of your child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.41,0:15:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的妻子要是知道你做出这等兽行\N{\fnArial\fs30}And may your wife turn from you for what you have done, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.81,0:15:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,日后你们黄泉相见 她不会原谅你\N{\fnArial\fs30}when she greets you in the afterlife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.28,0:15:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以前
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.40,0:15:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的是竞技场的冠军吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.20,0:15:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是跟纳美特斯人好上了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.86,0:15:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时的乐子嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.22,0:16:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥诺玛默斯看你回来好像不太高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oenomaus does not seem lifted by your return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.78,0:16:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没指望你们拿我当兄弟看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not think to be embraced as brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.38,0:16:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 我以为再也看不到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor I or to lay eyes upon you again in this life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.88,0:16:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你还是来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet here you stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.17,0:16:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是什么事情都这么容易过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would that all things were so easily done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.80,0:16:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们兄弟情深 我是见过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have seen the bond between you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.41,0:16:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管有怎样的隔阂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever the cause for disagreement, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.85,0:16:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,总会过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it will pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.06,0:16:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了求他原谅 我什么都愿意做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would do anything, to rise in his eyes again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.96,0:16:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,把民政官的婊子捉来 就开了个好头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capturing the praetor's bitch is a fine start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.21,0:16:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一手太漂亮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}An impressive act, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.05,0:16:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定能为我们的宏图大业助势\N{\fnArial\fs30}sure to further ignite our cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.12,0:16:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想结束这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seek only to end it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.51,0:16:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,解决了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is done, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.50,0:16:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}She yet lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.59,0:17:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不惜和罗马决裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brand myself fucking enemy of Rome{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.07,0:17:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她捉来给你处置\N{\fnArial\fs30}to deliver her to your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.19,0:17:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果你如此懦弱不堪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only to find them weak and trembling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.38,0:17:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是葛雷博\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not Glaber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.35,0:17:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以毫无怜悯地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Able to strike a woman down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.77,0:17:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,让女人为他的罪孽负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}for his crimes absent misgivings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.23,0:17:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些在卡普亚街头\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what of the women crucified{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.03,0:17:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,被钉死的女人怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the streets of Capua?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.66,0:17:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们痛苦地死去 只因为胆敢说出你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tortured to death because they dare whisper your name, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.30,0:17:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼里闪烁过自由和反叛的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}eyes bright with thoughts of freedom and rebellion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.50,0:17:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了她 了结这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the her life and end this now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.91,0:17:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则会有更多人因你而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or see countless more fall in the name of your cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.61,0:17:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,光是祈祷并不能帮我们走出黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prayer alone will not provide guidance through these dark times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.64,0:17:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须观望自身\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must look inward, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.94,0:17:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,从强大的内心获取力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}and find strength in heart's resolve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.06,0:17:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说诸神抛弃了你 正如抛弃了伊莉西娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the gods turn from you, as they do from Ilithyia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.00,0:17:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神时刻与我们同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are always with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.91,0:17:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神的意志存在于每次呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their will felt in every breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.59,0:18:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次触摸\N{\fnArial\fs30}In every touch…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.62,0:18:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们引导我们的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}They guide our hands, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.69,0:18:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助我们寻找正确的方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}compelling us toward proper course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.57,0:18:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尤斯听了会很高兴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gaius will be pleased to hear of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.65,0:18:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尤斯并不是拯救伊莉西娅的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not Gaius who holds the key to Ilithyia's salvation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.88,0:18:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,怕是诸神误导了你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear the gods have led you far astray then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.67,0:18:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我既不带兵 也不能召唤出甘尼克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I command no army, nor can I conjure Gannicus before us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.11,0:18:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你可以写信让瓦里留斯从罗马过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet message from you would bring Varinius from Rome, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.49,0:18:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他可以… - 盖尤斯说得很明确了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and with him - Gaius was clear in the matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.80,0:18:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能对任何人说起这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are to tell no one of what has happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.06,0:18:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这是铤而走险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Words borne of desperation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.80,0:18:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要保全名声 可现在情况很严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}He talks of shoring name while life's foundation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.27,0:18:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,日子都过不下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}crumbles beneath his feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.86,0:18:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛皮娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seppia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.79,0:18:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛皮娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seppia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.49,0:18:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你追求过民政官瓦里留斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sought Praetor Varinius' affections once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.78,0:18:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的话肯定能够打动他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send message, and you could yet gain them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.15,0:18:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是小孩子的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whims of a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.03,0:19:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在的想法成熟很多 早就没想那些事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such thoughts have been set aside in favor of mature pursuits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.53,0:19:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,忙了一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day has been long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.05,0:19:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来伺候你就寝吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will see you beneath the covers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.38,0:19:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事明早再议\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will revisit the subject with the morning sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.25,0:19:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我还不想睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies, I'm not yet for bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.86,0:19:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看看盖尤斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would check upon Gaius, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.84,0:19:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,说几句安慰的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}and offer words of comfort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.40,0:19:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是去跟他说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are words all that you would offer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.22,0:19:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在是他的客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am his guest in this house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.91,0:19:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人这么慷慨 我只想好好谢谢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And wish only to pay tribute to generous host.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.55,0:19:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样不值得 赛皮娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's beneath you, Seppia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.92,0:19:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神肯定有所察觉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods shall take ill notice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.06,0:19:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不正是诸神之手把哥哥从我身边带走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it not their hands that saw my brother struck from my side?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.47,0:19:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是诸神的旨意把我送到这里避难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their providence that sheltered me beneath this very roof?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.05,0:19:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有看到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you not see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.12,0:19:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神引导我一步步走近盖尤斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods have lead me upon path to Gaius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如他们把伊莉西娅带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}As their will has removed Ilithyia from it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.60,0:21:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,放宽心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.31,0:21:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I intend no harm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.26,0:21:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时是你帮了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the one that came to aid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.20,0:21:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我被带进来 那些畜生围着我的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When those animals turned upon me when I was brought in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.18,0:21:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别对我献殷勤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not clutch me to breast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.94,0:21:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和那些畜生一起拉屎放屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shit with the rest of those animals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.31,0:21:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了孩子 吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}For child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.30,0:21:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码你不会活活饿死\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least you will not die of hunger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.53,0:22:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有奴隶的烙印\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bear no brand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.11,0:22:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是自由人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a free man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.96,0:22:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是共和国公民 和你们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am of the Republic, as you and yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.49,0:22:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你还站在斯巴达克斯一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet you stand with Spartacus against it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.13,0:22:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我站在正义的一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stand for what is just.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.84,0:22:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,正义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.59,0:22:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯要摧毁我们拥有的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus moves to destroy everything we hold of worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.03,0:22:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还嫌他的动作太慢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he moves too late in my regard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.16,0:22:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏拉占了我的土地 夺走我的亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sulla seized my lands and those of my kin years ago, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.36,0:22:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死了胆敢抵抗的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}slaughtering any who resisted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.54,0:22:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,把偷来的东西赏给忠心耿耿的狗腿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And giving what he stole as gift to his most loyal of men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.41,0:22:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是罗马人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them fellow Romans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.01,0:22:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以想象你这些年是怎么过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a loss must weigh heavy in the passing of years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.91,0:22:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以帮你回到从前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would see burden lifted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.76,0:22:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你自身难保\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I mistake you for helpless, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.13,0:22:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到你还有让太阳西升东落\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet you have power to reverse the sun{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.99,0:23:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变过去的能力啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see past reformed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.65,0:23:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丈夫是罗马的民政官\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband is a praetor of Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.78,0:23:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是他的爱妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I of importance to him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.39,0:23:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,族人眼中的掌上明珠\N{\fnArial\fs30}being prized daughter of my clan, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.46,0:23:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,肚子里的孩子继承贵族血统和万贯家财\N{\fnArial\fs30}my child heir to its lineage and fortune{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.82,0:23:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种屁话留着跟诸神说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save vaunted words for grander ear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.20,0:23:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能放了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot free you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.61,0:23:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果放了你 走不出三步\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would both be absent fucking head{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.30,0:23:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我都要人头落地\N{\fnArial\fs30}before three steps could be taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.66,0:23:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不求你放我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not ask such a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.22,0:23:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你能替我捎个信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only that you carry message, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.78,0:23:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出斯巴达克斯的藏身之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}imparting where Spartacus holds me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.84,0:23:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用过这样的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not have to live this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.14,0:23:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需我丈夫一声令下\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that was taken from you can yet be restored, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.66,0:23:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去的一切都会回到你手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}with but simple command from my husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.49,0:23:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的损失可不是小数目\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sum of my loss is no small thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.05,0:23:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定能偿还\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can see it paid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.81,0:23:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,还给你过去的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your life returned to you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.94,0:23:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,以此交换我\N{\fnArial\fs30}in exchange for mine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.16,0:23:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及腹中孩子的性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the child I carry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.97,0:24:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说怀着你的种\N{\fnArial\fs30}She claims it yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.87,0:24:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,口气十分肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}With passion of certainty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.02,0:24:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是一条狡猾的毒蛇\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is a deceitful fucking snake, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.94,0:24:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那张嘴绝对吐不出真话\N{\fnArial\fs30}truth split by forked tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.54,0:24:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事情可能是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her words may hold such in this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.58,0:24:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得那晚在巴蒂塔斯的宅子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you recall the night in Batiatus' villa, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.50,0:24:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮我扮成金光闪闪的阿波罗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you aided in transforming likeness into golden Apollo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.29,0:24:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,去伺候罗马女人莱姬尼娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}To lay with the Roman woman Licinia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.57,0:24:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她戴着黛安娜女神的面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wore the mask of Diana.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.43,0:24:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果面具下的却不是莱姬尼娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet beneath it was not Licinia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.61,0:24:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是伊莉西娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilithyia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.55,0:24:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何不告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you not tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.72,0:24:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你有什么意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}What purpose would it have held?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.30,0:24:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}None.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.14,0:24:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在对你同样毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor should it hold any for you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.01,0:24:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是真的 她这样说只是为了保命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if true, she tells you only to stay your hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.98,0:25:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那她就太蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.96,0:25:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我知道她怀了孩子 而我妻子永远没机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}To know she carries heritage forever denied my own wife…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.62,0:25:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了伊莉西娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}See Ilithyia to her grave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.38,0:25:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,埋葬那些痛苦的回忆吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And tortured past buried beside her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.34,0:25:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,让葛雷博遭受同样的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make Glaber suffer as I have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.13,0:25:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我日思夜想 求之不得的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}at his hand is a thing I have craved more than air and breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.45,0:25:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是做出这样的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet in inflicting equal wound, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.06,0:25:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我岂不是变成了跟他一样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}how do I not become as the man himself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.22,0:25:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我妻子最厌恶的人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man my wife would turn from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.85,0:26:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先前还不确定你要不要我陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was not certain you would desire this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.39,0:26:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个男人不想要呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What man could not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.80,0:26:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟不是你关心的事情嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not the offering that gave concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.00,0:26:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是你遇到了这么大的不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rather your preoccupation with unfortunate events.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.69,0:26:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎那个孩子的命运如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fate of my heir does weigh mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.20,0:26:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你妻子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That of your wife's?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.48,0:26:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,更加不值一提\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thing of lesser notice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.10,0:27:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所谓的婚姻就这么不堪一击吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is bond of marriage really such a cold affair?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.29,0:27:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾几何时\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.95,0:27:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也轰轰烈烈地爱过\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the love between us burned hot, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.76,0:27:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,感情炽热如火\N{\fnArial\fs30}bright as noon-day sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.39,0:27:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是激情最终消退了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But day has turned to night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.46,0:27:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些宝贵的回忆也暗淡无光\N{\fnArial\fs30}casting golden memories to shadow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.30,0:27:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以让你重新燃起激情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have you bask in the light, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.63,0:27:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你这样的男人就该如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a man of your worth deserves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.76,0:27:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿比努斯可从来没这么看得起我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Albinius did not hold me to such esteem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.00,0:27:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,元老院的其他人都没有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor the rest of the Senate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.76,0:27:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就拿到斯巴达克斯的人头 给他们瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gaze into their eyes when you present Spartacus' head, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.24,0:27:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们肯定对你刮目相看\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see estimation soar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.52,0:27:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时给我哥哥报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my brother avenged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.36,0:28:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的死同样让你很伤心吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would that his death did not pain you so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.30,0:28:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一天天过去 我也逐渐走出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sting lessens with each passing day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.33,0:28:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.97,0:28:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我会报答你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I would return favor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.03,0:28:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你的妻子跟我哥哥一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}if your wife falls prey to Spartacus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.42,0:28:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,死在斯巴达克斯手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}as my brother fell…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.81,0:28:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的箱子里装满了金钱和鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your chest overflows with coin and blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.25,0:28:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,全是我辛苦赚来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both well earned by day's exertion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.05,0:28:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莉西娅有消息了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What news of Ilithyia did labors bring?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.69,0:28:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你每天就在民政官身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the praetor's ear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.58,0:28:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有跟你谈起过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he not already fill yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.75,0:28:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他围着赛皮娅团团转\N{\fnArial\fs30}His attentions toward young Seppia{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.73,0:29:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我连插句话的机会都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}prevent me from breaking words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.18,0:29:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻就是资本嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, the freshness of youth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.03,0:29:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道他会放着甜美的香唇不吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it a wonder he favors the caress of her tongue{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.43,0:29:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,听你唧唧歪歪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the sound of yours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.77,0:29:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,等伊莉西娅回来 她就失宠了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her bloom will wither, when Ilithyia returns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.79,0:29:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做这种指望可是相当不靠谱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You place great stock upon uncertain future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.37,0:29:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有打听到甘尼克斯的下落吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have not found path to Gannicus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.06,0:29:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾没有丝毫进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sadly it remains obscured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.18,0:29:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我真的是尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though not through lack of noble effort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.42,0:29:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们挨家挨户地打探\N{\fnArial\fs30}From there we moved from place to place, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.16,0:29:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,软硬兼施地逼问\N{\fnArial\fs30}questioning with fist and blade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.52,0:30:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是他们的回答全都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer always the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.11,0:30:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要向诸神献祭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will make sacrifice to the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.73,0:30:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,求他们给出更有价值的回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}And entreat them for more valued response.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.55,0:30:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起祈祷吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us pray together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.20,0:30:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一边爱抚缠绵 一边寻找启示\N{\fnArial\fs30}And seek divinity in warm embrace…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.55,0:30:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须尽快找到伊莉西娅和她肚子里的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilithyia and the child she carries must be found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.88,0:30:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果找不到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they are lost{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.69,0:30:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Hmmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.86,0:30:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳就不会再升起了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will the sun no longer move across the sky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.48,0:30:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是皎月掉进海底不出来了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will ivory moon plummet into frothing sea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.27,0:30:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再想那个臭婊子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strike the bitch from fucking thought, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.39,0:30:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛雷博早就不在乎她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}as Glaber has already done{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.60,0:30:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是你想打就打的低贱奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not your slave to lay fucking hand upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.88,0:30:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你早就想明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lesson I had thought already learned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.96,0:30:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.31,0:31:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话听着不够真诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I question sincerity of the word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.91,0:31:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.19,0:31:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.63,0:31:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.63,0:31:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.88,0:31:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里的地位还说不准呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your position in this house continues to spiral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.36,0:31:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快 除了跟着我 你别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon I will be all that stands between you and dark abyss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.04,0:31:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了那一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the day arrives…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.06,0:31:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意跟你亲热 那算是诸神的赏赐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you shall greet my breath upon your neck as precious gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.28,0:31:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白吗 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand this, my love?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.46,0:31:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.24,0:31:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是诸神的赏赐\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gift from the gods…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.81,0:32:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢修斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.50,0:32:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.01,0:32:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑子乱 去醒醒神\N{\fnArial\fs30}To clear troubled mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.04,0:32:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的脑子也很乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.33,0:32:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起走走吧 边走边聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us walk together for a moment, and break words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.95,0:32:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙拿一根木桩出气\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man unleashes wrath upon wooden form.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.18,0:32:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为他冒了那么大风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I have risked all for him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.77,0:32:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,带来复仇的机会 结果就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}to seize vengeance and end this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.44,0:32:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只不过是为了减轻良心的不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take risk only to lighten weighted conscience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.80,0:32:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望更多的人为他送命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not see more fall to foolish cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.65,0:33:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,更不希望我的兄弟牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I would not see my brother fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.74,0:33:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经不是兄弟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We no longer stand as such.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.27,0:33:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我们的关系就没有办法弥补吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there no path towards mended bond?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.16,0:33:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,镜花水月怎么弥补\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot mend illusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.43,0:33:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的兄弟情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our brotherhood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.72,0:33:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经对你的信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trust I placed upon you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.16,0:33:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都是谎言和欺骗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thing of lies and deceit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.66,0:33:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哪一天不是在煎熬中度过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you not think a day passes that I am not consumed by it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.49,0:33:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意拿我的命去换回梅莉塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would give my life for Melitta to yet own hers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.21,0:33:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我倒是很乐意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I would gladly take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.76,0:33:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怎么不动手呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what stays hand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.71,0:33:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和斯巴达克斯都这么犹豫不决吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you and Spartacus straddle same uncertain ground?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.07,0:33:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼前有复仇的机会却不去把握\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unable to take vengeance when it is placed before you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.44,0:33:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的死不能换回她的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your death would not see her again to my arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.52,0:33:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了你只会让你解脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would only serve as mercy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.04,0:33:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种慈悲的事情我不会做\N{\fnArial\fs30}releasing you from what you have done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.09,0:33:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我只能是罪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I stand condemned, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.70,0:33:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到死后才能解脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}until the afterlife takes me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.89,0:34:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stand for nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.92,0:34:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一如既往\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you always have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.14,0:34:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must wait…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.32,0:34:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到斯巴达克斯让我们换岗\N{\fnArial\fs30}till Spartacus relieves us of charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.29,0:34:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,实在太难熬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time passes too slowly…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.42,0:34:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们要速战速决\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must be quick then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.29,0:34:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就是这么站岗的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how you stand guard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.04,0:34:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我们是在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies, we were…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.07,0:34:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在…是在… - 我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ah, we were we were, we were just - we{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.68,0:34:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,上床去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take to your bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.39,0:34:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来看着伊莉西娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will assume watch over Ilithyia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.77,0:35:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,感激不尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.11,0:35:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.85,0:35:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想再喝点水\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have more water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.40,0:35:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这感觉太可怕了 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a terrible thing, is it not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.49,0:35:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,活在贫穷与恐惧之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}To live in want and fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.74,0:35:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是当奴隶的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is what it is to be a slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.82,0:35:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.32,0:35:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是为了我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}For my child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.23,0:35:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.23,0:35:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟斯巴达克斯说的那些话\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you told Spartacus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.53,0:35:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向诸神发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.88,0:35:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果斯巴达克斯杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Spartacus takes my life, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.73,0:36:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他就相当于杀了他亲骨肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}the blood of his child will forever stain his own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.87,0:36:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a good man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.33,0:36:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让他受到这种打击\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not let him be destroyed by this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.46,0:36:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让他杀你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not let him kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.39,0:36:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will help me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.28,0:36:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我会帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I will help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.75,0:36:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮你离开人世\N{\fnArial\fs30}From this fucking world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.69,0:36:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you lost mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.74,0:36:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀她是迟早的事 我不过代你动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I move only to spare you from what must be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.66,0:36:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you take her life, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.81,0:36:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就永远良心不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}the deed will weigh every breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.17,0:36:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是你来选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you remove choice, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.54,0:37:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来接受这样的命运吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and invite such fate upon yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.21,0:37:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以坦然面对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would embrace it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.71,0:37:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你的心不受到折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see your heart spared from the act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.11,0:37:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不懂我的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not know my heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.89,0:37:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.23,0:37:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.35,0:37:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明确地告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have words now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.32,0:37:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里的日子结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And see your time here at an end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.68,0:38:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有如朝阳般光彩照人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You glow like the morning sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.62,0:38:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,想必睡得很香\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have slept well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.01,0:38:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全没这回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardly at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.81,0:38:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太不幸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an unfortunate thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.14,0:38:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not deem it so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.29,0:38:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕你应该这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear you shall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.39,0:38:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,退下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.28,0:38:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不准你这么威胁我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not have you threaten in such a manner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.49,0:38:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这可不算威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not move to threats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.96,0:38:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是想警告你 那个男人不值得你爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only to warning about the man you turn affections towards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.71,0:38:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就凭几句话不能让我离开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your words will not turn me from him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.12,0:38:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要用言语打动你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time for them has passed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.53,0:38:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.44,0:38:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你看一样实实在在的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have something more tangible to show you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.34,0:38:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,民政官在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the praetor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.47,0:38:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他房里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In his chamber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.79,0:38:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.46,0:38:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人带来了伊莉西娅的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man comes with news of Ilithyia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.51,0:39:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你说有我妻子的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}You claim to have knowledge of my wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.84,0:39:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than claim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.11,0:39:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在斯巴达克斯的手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is being held by Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.30,0:39:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}She lives?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.44,0:39:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是暂时\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.98,0:39:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.31,0:39:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚从叛军的营地过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have just traveled from the rebel's camp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.82,0:39:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是他的手下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stand as one of his men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.10,0:39:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是逃犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am no fugitivus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.59,0:39:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个疲惫的老头子罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a tired old man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.86,0:39:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望能在入土之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeking what little peace he can{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.38,0:39:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽可能找到一点点慰藉\N{\fnArial\fs30}before falling to eternal slumber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.94,0:39:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你告诉我她在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, tell me where she's being held{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.68,0:39:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就重重有赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you will be seen to great reward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.81,0:39:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的妻子吹嘘说你很慷慨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife boasted of your generosity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.97,0:39:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,许诺归还我被混蛋苏拉夺去的土地\N{\fnArial\fs30}and promised the return of my lands seized by the bastard Sulla.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.06,0:39:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事有可能吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is such a thing possible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.50,0:39:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个我能办到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is within my power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.89,0:39:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我自己的妻子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what of my own wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.28,0:39:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.53,0:39:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的兄弟姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brothers and sisters, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.94,0:39:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们全都被罗马人屠杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}all slaughtered in the name of Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.22,0:39:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也能把他们归还给我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it within your power to return them to too, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.25,0:40:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,婊子养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you fucking cunt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.84,0:40:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,动我一根毫毛 你妻子就没命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lay a hand on me and your wife dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.84,0:40:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没能按时回去 她也会没命\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I do not return within reasonable hour, she dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.18,0:40:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要派人跟踪我 她也会没命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any attempts to follow me, she dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.94,0:40:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯要我怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would Spartacus have of me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.86,0:40:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尤斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gaius{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.72,0:40:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.19,0:40:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要在太阳初升之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are to enter the city of Atella on foot, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.35,0:40:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,徒步走进阿泰拉城\N{\fnArial\fs30}just before rise of morning sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.22,0:40:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以带三个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three of your men allowed by your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.76,0:40:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus to hold the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.67,0:40:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那伊莉西娅呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Ilithyia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.13,0:40:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着她就会回到你身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}She will be returned to you afterwards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.24,0:40:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,条件是拿一辆马车来换\N{\fnArial\fs30}In exchange for a single wagon, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.90,0:40:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中装满盔甲与武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}heavily weighted with armor and weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.00,0:40:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,把军备送给罗马的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give arms to the enemies of Rome?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.09,0:40:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是他的价码\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is his price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.41,0:40:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果看到你带军队去阿泰拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your troops are seen on road to Atella, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.12,0:41:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯就不会现身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus will not appear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.39,0:41:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你的妻子和她肚里的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your wife and the child she carries, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.78,0:41:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就别想再见到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}be lost to you forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.52,0:41:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有说过动我一根毫毛的后果吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I mention the part about laying hands upon me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.15,0:41:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.45,0:41:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信他的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not trust this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.78,0:41:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.29,0:41:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还是要采取行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet action must be taken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.08,0:41:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备一辆马车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare a wagon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.40,0:41:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,民政官大人 我们给了武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praetor, we can not aid them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.94,0:41:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后打起仗来就更麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}with means to forge further war upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.13,0:41:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯给了我们别的选择吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What choice has Spartacus left?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.12,0:41:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用顺着他的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are always choices.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.55,0:41:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.00,0:41:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯只给了一条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus leaves but one path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.34,0:41:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只有顺着走过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I must travel upon it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.64,0:42:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老了 但可不傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am old, but not a fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.04,0:42:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这次深入虎穴 我有太多想问你的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was much to ask, entering the lair of the beast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.00,0:42:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,当面羞辱民政官的感觉棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh it was great pleasure, to piss in the face of a fucking praetor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.64,0:42:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.29,0:42:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛雷博答应这些条件了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glaber agrees to the terms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.91,0:42:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去阿泰拉 完成这笔交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am for Atella, to see it done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.64,0:42:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就拿他的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us take his weapons!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.98,0:42:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,取了他的狗命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his fucking life!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.47,0:42:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.59,0:42:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不信守承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we do not honor word, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.72,0:42:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就和罗马人没两样\N{\fnArial\fs30}we prove ourselves no better than the Romans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.34,0:42:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要遵守诺言\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall hold to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.60,0:42:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果只能有三个人随你同去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If three are all that can be seen with you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.37,0:42:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,算我一个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would count myself among them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.89,0:42:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是 不管与谁同行\N{\fnArial\fs30}As would I, despite the company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.65,0:42:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would join as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.04,0:42:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,再欢迎不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would welcome no one as warmly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.57,0:42:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你在竞技场受的伤还没有好全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet you have not healed from ordeal in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.66,0:42:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来替他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will stand in his place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.12,0:43:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都不赞同我们所做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a cause you do not believe in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.23,0:43:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥诺玛默斯赞同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oenomaus believes in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.53,0:43:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许有一天我也能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps one day I shall too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.34,0:43:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得带趁手的武器回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return with proper weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.27,0:43:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你们的小命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.01,0:43:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有疯子才会相信葛雷博的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is madness to place trust in the words of Glaber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.07,0:43:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是相信他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not place it with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.48,0:43:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是相信所有跟我同行的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I place it with all those I take with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.11,0:43:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起完成这笔交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will see this done, together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.39,0:43:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后武装起来 让葛雷博及其军队彻底消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}And gain means to strike Glaber and his army from this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.30,0:44:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.12,0:44:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那老头说我妻子在你手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old man claims you have my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.98,0:44:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是从她裙子上割下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut from her dress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.79,0:44:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有她的气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her scent yet upon it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.24,0:44:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,从她尸体上也能拿到这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thing easily taken from a body robbed of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.38,0:44:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来有过这种想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}My thoughts turned toward such a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.69,0:45:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,白刀子进红刀子出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blade parting flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.91,0:45:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她血流满地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her blood upon the ground, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.60,0:45:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我妻子当时一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}as my wife's blood was spilled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.43,0:45:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你没有杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet you do not claim her life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.23,0:45:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不像你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.82,0:45:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让一个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not strike down a woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.26,0:45:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,承担她丈夫犯下的罪孽\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the foolish acts of her husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.85,0:45:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在死人的胸前刻上我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}You carved my name into a dead man's chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.47,0:45:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在卡普亚的光天化日之下刺杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make attempt against my life in the streets of Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.54,0:45:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,又在竞技场下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then again in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.43,0:45:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你竟然放弃了报仇雪恨的大好良机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet you turn from most assured opportunity to balance debt between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.95,0:45:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I turn from nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.71,0:45:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久之后 我定要取你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day soon, I will have your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.43,0:45:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,把马车赶到前面来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring the wagon forward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.71,0:45:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有很多遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hold many regrets, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.63,0:45:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,从很久以前我们初次见面开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}since first we laid eyes on each other a lifetime ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.82,0:46:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望这次不要有什么遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray this decision does not stand amongst them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.39,0:46:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的妻子就要重回怀抱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will hold your wife again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.05,0:46:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会为你生下子嗣\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she will deliver you an heir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.55,0:46:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 当你看着孩子的眼睛时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet when you gaze into the child's eyes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.77,0:46:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,总能看到我的影子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will forever be reflected there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.36,0:46:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为是我饶了你孩子的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}in memory of how I spared them both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.60,0:46:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怕是说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear you are right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.13,0:46:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.02,0:46:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妻子是你的心头肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife was the heart that beats within your breast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.00,0:46:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了保护她 你愿意牺牲一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would have given all to see her live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.20,0:46:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我也愿意付出任何代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}While I would do the same…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.72,0:46:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,要你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see you dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.03,0:47:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.13,0:48:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,出手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.19,0:48:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,找掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take cover!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.59,0:48:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨尔维斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salvius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.22,0:48:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,发号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give call!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.98,0:49:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.81,0:49:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该早点叫我们出手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You waited long enough to give signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.77,0:49:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能有失荣誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cling to honor ignored.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.80,0:49:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.32,0:49:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,别等他们缓过劲来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before they recover!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.93,0:49:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take to foot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.39,0:49:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来断后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would stay awhile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.72,0:49:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢修斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucius{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.93,0:49:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.17,0:49:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别等我他妈的恢复理智了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before I come to fucking sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.25,0:50:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少不是该死的罗马人杀…\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least it's not a fucking Roman that takes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.64,0:50:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他们进树林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not let them breach the woods!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.39,0:50:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.31,0:50:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本没打算做交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never intended to make trade?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.50,0:50:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打算要斯巴达克斯的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I intended to send Spartacus to his death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.20,0:50:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可这背信弃义的家伙竟然一次次逃脱制裁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deserved fate he yet evades through treachery and deceit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.19,0:50:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很快就能抓到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will have him soon enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.00,0:50:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,牺牲妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}At price of wife, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.50,0:50:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有神赐的孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the blessing she carries?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.17,0:50:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意牺牲整个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would gladly pay the sum of the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.27,0:50:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我能踩住他的喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}to have his throat beneath my heel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.96,0:50:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莉西娅必须回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilithyia must return to this house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.65,0:50:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神预见…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods have foreseen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.57,0:50:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果诸神真想救她的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods can descend from their fucking heavens{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.81,0:50:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就从天上滚下来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}if they wish to see her live!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.63,0:51:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这几天我要哀悼失去的妻子和孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}In coming days I shall grieve loss of wife and child, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.61,0:51:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有她家的那一大笔遗产\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the fortunes carried upon her family name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.78,0:51:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们与你共同哀悼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we shall grieve with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.14,0:51:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去洗个澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would see myself to bath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.28,0:51:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗掉所有的血迹和烦恼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And blood and troubled thoughts of moment washed away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.16,0:51:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.84,0:51:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去拿酒给你解愁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will bring more wine to aid endeavor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.60,0:51:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他做了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what he has done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.87,0:51:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,必要的事情呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What he felt he must, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.97,0:51:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了干掉斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see an end to Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.13,0:51:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他牺牲了整个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has pulled the world to ruin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.29,0:51:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,逼得所有人活不下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with it reason for living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.30,0:52:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的担心吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your reason perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.00,0:52:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我活得好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My heart yet beats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.44,0:52:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你哥哥呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what of your brother's?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.53,0:52:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尤斯正在替他报仇呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gaius moves to avenge his death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.47,0:52:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他应该找自个儿报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he should turn wrath upon himself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.80,0:52:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,自行了断\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see it done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.79,0:52:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你哥哥的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your brother's, is it not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.70,0:52:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为是奴隶杀了他然后顺手抢走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had thought his slaves took it with his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.34,0:52:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实他们什么都没有干\N{\fnArial\fs30}They stand blemished by neither offense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.00,0:52:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么拿到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you come by this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.51,0:52:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神指引我找到真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods led me to the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.60,0:52:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏在阿舒尔的财物当中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hidden amongst Ashur's treasures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.66,0:52:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些东西都是他杀人后从尸体上取下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stripped from the bodies of those who have died at his hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.46,0:52:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿舒尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ashur?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.86,0:52:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时他肯定在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have been there that night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.88,0:52:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥死的那一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}when your brother fell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.45,0:52:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这个坏家伙只听命于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet the villain moves only upon command{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.60,0:52:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尤斯•克罗迪斯•葛雷博\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Gaius Claudius Glaber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.95,0:53:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们失去了太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much has been lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.57,0:53:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ones we have loved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.18,0:53:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以为能永远有他们的陪伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ones we thought would forever be at our side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.43,0:53:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过失去了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in their passing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.16,0:53:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,禁锢我们欲望的锁链也随之打破了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the chains that bound us to desires not our own have been struck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.89,0:53:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁链不打破\N{\fnArial\fs30}And without such a blow, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.43,0:53:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今天也不会在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}we would not find ourselves in each other's arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.70,0:53:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.46,0:53:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.26,0:53:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kneel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.95,0:53:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.62,0:53:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那种感觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what it is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.54,0:54:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}To love?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.85,0:54:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,心里充满光明和希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be filled with light and hope?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.97,0:54:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界只有那一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see that blessing returned in kind, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.15,0:54:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,最懂你的内心\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the eyes of the only one{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.55,0:54:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这是上天的赐福\N{\fnArial\fs30}that could ever know the true depth of your heart?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.51,0:54:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你丈夫夺走了这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is what your husband took from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.37,0:54:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让他付出同样的代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would take the same from him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.03,0:54:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他选择向我复仇 而不是救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet he chose vengeance against me over your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.26,0:55:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了你 报不了我的仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking it would balance nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.66,0:55:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does not love you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.72,0:55:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我爱我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}as I loved my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.98,0:55:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你放我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let me live?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.57,0:55:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,别以为我是好心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not think it a kindness.{\r}
